    <code code="18776-5" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Plan of care note"/>
    <title>Plan of Treatment</title>
    <text><list><item>Urgent MRI of the brain with and without gadolinium, with diffusion imaging and MR angiography of the head and neck, within three days; EEG within a week; ECG, blood count, metabolic panel, calcium, and TSH today; headache and episode diary. Guideline: NCCN Clinical Practice Guidelines in Oncology: Central Nervous System Cancers, Version 2.2025 (2025); Evidence-based guideline: Management of an unprovoked first seizure in adults. Krumholz A, et al. Neurology 2015;84(16):1705-1713 (2015) [S]</item><item>Safety now: no driving until the cause is known and her seizures are controlled for the period her state requires; showers rather than baths, no swimming alone, and no work at heights; seizure first aid explained; come at once for a longer episode, weakness that does not recover, or a severe sudden headache. Guideline: Evidence-based guideline: Management of an unprovoked first seizure in adults. Krumholz A, et al. Neurology 2015;84(16):1705-1713 (2015) [S]</item><item>Neurosurgery consultation if the MRI shows a structural lesion, to explain the options and their risks to her and plan treatment with her. Guideline: NCCN Clinical Practice Guidelines in Oncology: Central Nervous System Cancers, Version 2.2025 (2025) [S]</item><item>Grief and mood: a grief history, PHQ-9 and GAD-7 at each visit, and the neuro-oncology counselor offered; no assumption that her symptoms are &quot;nerves&quot;. Guideline: Depression and Suicide Risk in Adults: Screening (2023); CMID: Clinical Monitoring Intelligence Database, depression, bipolar, and mood disorders monograph (depression screening and PHQ-9 follow-up) (2026) [S]</item><item>Protect her writing: occupational therapy assessment of hand function if weakness persists, and voice dictation as a backup. Guideline: NCCN Clinical Practice Guidelines in Oncology: Central Nervous System Cancers, Version 2.2025 (2025) [S]</item></list></text>

  </section>
